    <item>
      <title>Linus Torvalds一声吼：Linux不反AI，不服Fork或滚！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/linus-torvaldslinuxaifork-20260716191005658-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 19:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
